'''TD-787'''<ref name="Born in the Storm" /> was a [[human]]<ref name="ECUC" /> [[Gender|male]] [[stormtrooper]] [[sergeant]] who served the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Born in the Storm" /> TD-787 wore a [[backpack]], a [[Color|white]] [[pauldron]], and augmented [[stormtrooper armor]]. He also utilized a [[DLT-19 heavy blaster rifle]].<ref name="Episode IV">{{Film|IV}}</ref>

